    },
    {
        "id": 69,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_002_amiya_1#4\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#4.png"
    },
    {
        "id": 70,
        "raw": "[name=\"Amiya\"]  Yeah.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Amiya",
        "content": "Yeah."
    },
    {
        "id": 71,
        "raw": "[name=\"Amiya\"]  This is how it is for Rhodes Island... most of the time.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Amiya",
        "content": "This is how it is for Rhodes Island... most of the time."
    },
    {
        "id": 72,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_002_amiya_1#7\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7.png"
    },
    {
        "id": 73,
        "raw": "[name=\"Amiya\"]  But even if there's only the tiniest bit we can do, we will do it.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Amiya",
        "content": "But even if there's only the tiniest bit we can do, we will do it."
    },
    {
        "id": 74,
        "raw": "[name=\"Amiya\"]  We have to.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Amiya",
        "content": "We have to."
    },
    {
        "id": 75,
        "raw": "[Predicate(references=\"2\")]",
        "type": "predicate",
        "references": "2"
    },
    {
        "id": 76,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_002_amiya_1#4\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#4.png"
    },
    {
        "id": 77,
        "raw": "[name=\"Amiya\"]  What are you thinking, Doctor?",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Amiya",
        "content": "What are you thinking, Doctor?"
    },
    {
        "id": 78,
        "raw": "[name=\"Amiya\"]  Are you thinking about... all the death we've seen?",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Amiya",
        "content": "Are you thinking about... all the death we've seen?"
    },
    {
        "id": 79,
        "raw": "[name=\"Amiya\"]  I can't guess. And I don't want to take it from your mind.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Amiya",
        "content": "I can't guess. And I don't want to take it from your mind."
    },
    {
        "id": 80,
        "raw": "[name=\"Amiya\"]  Because... I think one day you'll tell me yourself.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Amiya",
        "content": "Because... I think one day you'll tell me yourself."
    },
    {
        "id": 81,
        "raw": "[Predicate(references=\"3\")]",
        "type": "predicate",
        "references": "3"
    },
    {
        "id": 82,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_002_amiya_1#4\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#4.png"
    },
    {
        "id": 83,
        "raw": "[name=\"Amiya\"]  The operators have put in the work.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Amiya",
        "content": "The operators have put in the work."
    },
    {
        "id": 84,
        "raw": "[name=\"Amiya\"]  But death makes a heavy impression, heavier than saving someone. Every time we witness such death, it hits hard.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Amiya",
        "content": "But death makes a heavy impression, heavier than saving someone. Every time we witness such death, it hits hard."
    },
    {
        "id": 85,
        "raw": "[name=\"Amiya\"]  Just remember that without the efforts of our operators, we'd be seeing a lot more death.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Amiya",
        "content": "Just remember that without the efforts of our operators, we'd be seeing a lot more death."
    },
    {
        "id": 86,
        "raw": "[name=\"Amiya\"]  So much more death...",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Amiya",
        "content": "So much more death..."
    },
    {
        "id": 87,
        "raw": "[Predicate(references=\"1;2;3\")]",
        "type": "predicate",
        "references": "1;2;3"
    },
    {
        "id": 88,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_367_swllow_1\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_367_swllow_1.png"
    },
    {
        "id": 89,
        "raw": "[name=\"GreyThroat\"]  I used to think Rhodes Island fought for the Infected.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "GreyThroat",
        "content": "I used to think Rhodes Island fought for the Infected."
    },
    {
        "id": 90,
        "raw": "[name=\"GreyThroat\"]  But now I see all the dead at our feet, they're all Infected.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "GreyThroat",
        "content": "But now I see all the dead at our feet, they're all Infected."
    },
    {
        "id": 91,
        "raw": "[name=\"GreyThroat\"]  Amiya...",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "GreyThroat",
        "content": "Amiya..."
    },
    {
        "id": 92,
        "raw": "[name=\"GreyThroat\"]  Why does Rhodes Island fight?",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "GreyThroat",
        "content": "Why does Rhodes Island fight?"
    },
