    },
    {
        "id": 98,
        "raw": "[name=\"Blaze\"]  Now you ask?",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Blaze",
        "content": "Now you ask?"
    },
    {
        "id": 99,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_017_homura_3#9\",name2=\"char_002_amiya_1#4\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_017_homura_3#9.png",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 100,
        "raw": "[name=\"Amiya\"]  Blaze.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Amiya",
        "content": "Blaze."
    },
    {
        "id": 101,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_017_homura_3#5\",name2=\"char_002_amiya_1#4\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_017_homura_3#5.png",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 102,
        "raw": "[name=\"Blaze\"]  ...Answer her.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Blaze",
        "content": "...Answer her."
    },
    {
        "id": 103,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_002_amiya_1#4\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#4.png"
    },
    {
        "id": 104,
        "raw": "[name=\"Amiya\"]  Honestly, I ask myself the same question all the time.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Amiya",
        "content": "Honestly, I ask myself the same question all the time."
    },
    {
        "id": 105,
        "raw": "[name=\"Amiya\"]  We see people, Infected and uninfected, die every day.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Amiya",
        "content": "We see people, Infected and uninfected, die every day."
    },
    {
        "id": 106,
        "raw": "[name=\"Amiya\"]  We don't, and we shouldn't fight to stop every death. That would be meaningless in the grand scheme of things.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Amiya",
        "content": "We don't, and we shouldn't fight to stop every death. That would be meaningless in the grand scheme of things."
    },
    {
        "id": 107,
        "raw": "[name=\"Amiya\"]  Like now... like in this battle in front of us.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Amiya",
        "content": "Like now... like in this battle in front of us."
    },
    {
        "id": 108,
        "raw": "[name=\"Amiya\"]  It wasn't one crossbow, one Art, one explosion, or one wound that causes all the death.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Amiya",
        "content": "It wasn't one crossbow, one Art, one explosion, or one wound that causes all the death."
    },
    {
        "id": 109,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_002_amiya_1#7\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7.png"
    },
    {
        "id": 110,
        "raw": "[name=\"Amiya\"]  What we fight to defeat is the source of all of this... the hatred the uninfected have for the Infected, and vice versa, is the reason they kill each other.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Amiya",
        "content": "What we fight to defeat is the source of all of this... the hatred the uninfected have for the Infected, and vice versa, is the reason they kill each other."
    },
    {
        "id": 111,
        "raw": "[name=\"Amiya\"]  We must tear up the soil that nurtures the hate. Using our pharmaceuticals, and our operations.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Amiya",
        "content": "We must tear up the soil that nurtures the hate. Using our pharmaceuticals, and our operations."
    },
    {
