        "name": "char_017_homura_3#5.png"
    },
    {
        "id": 121,
        "raw": "[name=\"Blaze\"]  Ah——",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Blaze",
        "content": "Ah——"
    },
    {
        "id": 122,
        "raw": "[name=\"Blaze\"]  Did Reunion fire that?",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Blaze",
        "content": "Did Reunion fire that?"
    },
    {
        "id": 123,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_017_homura_3#5\",name2=\"char_002_amiya_1#7\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_017_homura_3#5.png",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 124,
        "raw": "[name=\"Amiya\"]  That was an Originium-boosted crossbow bolt.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Amiya",
        "content": "That was an Originium-boosted crossbow bolt."
    },
    {
        "id": 125,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_017_homura_3#5\",name2=\"char_002_amiya_1#7\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_017_homura_3#5.png",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 126,
        "raw": "[name=\"Blaze\"]  Pretty lousy fireworks.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Blaze",
        "content": "Pretty lousy fireworks."
    },
    {
        "id": 127,
        "raw": "[name=\"Blaze\"]  Nearl said, back in Chernobog, the scaly kid was pretty strong.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Blaze",
        "content": "Nearl said, back in Chernobog, the scaly kid was pretty strong."
    },
    {
        "id": 128,
        "raw": "[name=\"Blaze\"]  She told me her arms nearly broke. And I'll tell you from experience, I wouldn't be able to break them.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Blaze",
        "content": "She told me her arms nearly broke. And I'll tell you from experience, I wouldn't be able to break them."
    },
    {
        "id": 129,
        "raw": "[name=\"Blaze\"]  But back there, I knew his bowstring was as good as snapped, and he didn't have much Arts left in his weapon.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Blaze",
        "content": "But back there, I knew his bowstring was as good as snapped, and he didn't have much Arts left in his weapon."
    },
    {
        "id": 130,
        "raw": "[name=\"Blaze\"]  What happened to you, you little shit?",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Blaze",
        "content": "What happened to you, you little shit?"
    },
    {
        "id": 131,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_017_homura_3#5\",name2=\"char_002_amiya_1#4\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_017_homura_3#5.png",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 132,
        "raw": "[name=\"Amiya\"]  I think... maybe... he had no reason to fight anymore.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Amiya",
        "content": "I think... maybe... he had no reason to fight anymore."
    },
    {
        "id": 133,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_017_homura_3#5\",name2=\"char_002_amiya_1#4\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_017_homura_3#5.png",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 134,
        "raw": "[name=\"Blaze\"]  Hey, Amiya, would it be possible that he used some sort of Arts and survived from the attack?",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Blaze",
        "content": "Hey, Amiya, would it be possible that he used some sort of Arts and survived from the attack?"
    },
    {
        "id": 135,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_017_homura_3#5\",name2=\"char_002_amiya_1#4\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_017_homura_3#5.png",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 136,
        "raw": "[name=\"Amiya\"]  ...I'm sorry.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Amiya",
        "content": "...I'm sorry."
    },
    {
        "id": 137,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_017_homura_3#5\",name2=\"char_002_amiya_1#4\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_017_homura_3#5.png",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 138,
        "raw": "[name=\"Blaze\"]  What are you sorry for? I just pity the kid. Looking at him, I can tell he wasn't a bad guy.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Blaze",
        "content": "What are you sorry for? I just pity the kid. Looking at him, I can tell he wasn't a bad guy."
    },
    {
        "id": 139,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_367_swllow_1\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_367_swllow_1.png"
    },
    {
        "id": 140,
        "raw": "[name=\"GreyThroat\"]  It's too late for any of that now.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "GreyThroat",
        "content": "It's too late for any of that now."
    },
    {
        "id": 141,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_002_amiya_1#1\",name2=\"char_367_swllow_1\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#1.png",
        "name2": "char_367_swllow_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 142,
        "raw": "[name=\"Amiya\"]  No it's not.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Amiya",
        "content": "No it's not."
    },
    {
        "id": 143,
        "raw": "[name=\"Amiya\"]  The tragedies of the past carry on into the present... And we still have a chance to stop the tragedies of the future.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Amiya",
        "content": "The tragedies of the past carry on into the present... And we still have a chance to stop the tragedies of the future."
    },
    {
        "id": 144,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_002_amiya_1#1\",name2=\"char_367_swllow_1\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#1.png",
        "name2": "char_367_swllow_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 145,
        "raw": "[name=\"GreyThroat\"]  ......",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "GreyThroat",
        "content": "......"
    },
    {
        "id": 146,
        "raw": "[name=\"GreyThroat\"]  I'll get his crossbow.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "GreyThroat",
        "content": "I'll get his crossbow."
    },
